# HyperCode BIG folders
# Anchored to repo root (leading /) so it doesn't also catch src/agents/ —
# hyper-architect/hyper-observer/hyper-worker/agent-x all build with
# context: . and need their own agents/<name>/ (plus, for the hyper-agents
# trio, src/agents/hyper_agents/) reachable. Found/fixed incrementally
# 2026-08-20 during the first real fleet launch attempt — same bug class each
# time, just missed on the agents this session hadn't build-tested standalone
# before (agent-x/hyper-architect weren't part of the earlier item-#9 audit,
# which only covered agents-full.yml's own definitions).
/agents/
!/agents/agent-x/
!/agents/agent-x/**
!/agents/hyper-agents/architect/
!/agents/hyper-agents/architect/**
!/agents/hyper-agents/observer/
!/agents/hyper-agents/observer/**
!/agents/hyper-agents/worker/
!/agents/hyper-agents/worker/**
backend/
frontend/node_modules/
celery/
redis/
postgres/
minio/
ollama/
helm/
scripts/
monitoring/
k8s/
notes/
examples/
tools/
.husky/
.trae/

